      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王累积了不少疲劳，\n于是我让她到保健室休息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0347ac028bd1292c187b934cc1d5daa369edb920aaade57940e7a7773619b27a",
